Q197881.description:
Cropped illustration of Adel Shah from the Four Portraits from the St. Petersburg Album. Mughal school, 18th century. Art Institute of Chicago 1919.952 recto.
This is the following source that considers it to have been a portrait of him;

"The St. Petersburg Muraqqa'. Album of Indian and Persian Miniatures From the 16th Century and Specimens of Persian Calligraphy by 'Imad al-Hasani", Leonardo Arte, Milano 1996, pp. 122-123
